[General] Now that every `desc` in this file gained a trailing `.`, the documentation table in `instrumentation/jmx-metrics/library/wildfly.md` is out of sync (it's the same convention `tomcat.md` follows, where the doc descriptions match `tomcat.yaml` exactly). Could you update it in this PR?

Concretely, in `wildfly.md`:

- add the trailing `.` to all 15 rows in the `Description` column;
- `wildfly.session.active.limit` is documented as `The maximum supported number of active sessions`, but the rule says `The maximum number of active sessions.` — worth aligning while you're there;
- also pre-existing but adjacent: `wildfly.error.count` is documented with unit `{error}`, while both this rule file and the new `model/wildfly.yaml` use `{request}`.
